msgstr "请在运行 wl-color-picker 之前安装它们。"

msgid "No Wayland session found."
msgstr "未找到 Wayland 会话。"

msgid "This color picker must be run under a valid Wayland session."
msgstr "此取色器必须在有效的 Wayland 会话中运行。"

msgid "Select color"
msgstr "选择颜色"

